      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002C0020007400680061006E006B00200079006F00750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes, a wise decision.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIf you lack faith in your ability to read opponents,\nit’s best to avoid futile battles.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 117
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So you’re confident that you can see my incredibly\npowerful Pokémon for what they truly are, hm?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nWell then, I’m quite excited for this battle!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
