    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Despite how they may look, all of my Pokémon are\nfierce fighters, seasoned by battle and brimming<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwith strength.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 120
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Some opponents take one look at their oh-so-\nadorable faces and drop their guard, only to be<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nswiftly crushed by our might!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That kind of thing doesn’t happen with Trainers\nwho are serious about battling.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAfter all, they can pick up on a Pokémon’s true\nstrength pretty quickly when they see it in action.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 187
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’re told not to make assumptions based on\nappearances, but we do it anyway because the<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfact is...you can’t know what’s under the surface.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWhich is why my Pokémon and I will continue\nto take advantage of anyone foolish enough to<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nunderestimate us!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕū",
